    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the training mode &quot;Crypta&quot; of the stylish action game [RADIUS BLOOD] in development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcHigh-Mobility Slash</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/4f02c0bb386d65ae5695e6e4d35b392b.poster.avif?t=1752807601\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/4f02c0bb386d65ae5695e6e4d35b392b.webm?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/4f02c0bb386d65ae5695e6e4d35b392b.mp4?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can be used to pursue enemies that have been blown away, and by attacking the weak point that temporarily appears on the boss's body, you can deal large damage to the boss's shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcAttack after Perfect Dodge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0e2ae622f73085d2be2a1d736025e413.poster.avif?t=1752807601\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0e2ae622f73085d2be2a1d736025e413.webm?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0e2ae622f73085d2be2a1d736025e413.mp4?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read what's coming next and incorporate even evasion into stylish combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcSwitch finisher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0a839f150afbe025a7199326aba4720b.poster.avif?t=1752807601\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0a839f150afbe025a7199326aba4720b.webm?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0a839f150afbe025a7199326aba4720b.mp4?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can switch the finisher attribute of the attack with the arrow button down (default). Even if the enemy's health is at 0, you can still finish off the enemy at desired timing.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the training mode &quot;Crypta&quot; of the stylish action game [RADIUS BLOOD] in development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcHigh-Mobility Slash</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/4f02c0bb386d65ae5695e6e4d35b392b.poster.avif?t=1752807601\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/4f02c0bb386d65ae5695e6e4d35b392b.webm?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/4f02c0bb386d65ae5695e6e4d35b392b.mp4?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can be used to pursue enemies that have been blown away, and by attacking the weak point that temporarily appears on the boss's body, you can deal large damage to the boss's shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcAttack after Perfect Dodge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0e2ae622f73085d2be2a1d736025e413.poster.avif?t=1752807601\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0e2ae622f73085d2be2a1d736025e413.webm?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0e2ae622f73085d2be2a1d736025e413.mp4?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read what's coming next and incorporate even evasion into stylish combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcSwitch finisher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0a839f150afbe025a7199326aba4720b.poster.avif?t=1752807601\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0a839f150afbe025a7199326aba4720b.webm?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115020/extras/0a839f150afbe025a7199326aba4720b.mp4?t=1752807601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can switch the finisher attribute of the attack with the arrow button down (default). Even if the enemy's health is at 0, you can still finish off the enemy at desired timing.</p>",
